OL,3,GNEWSAHow do you navigate Halloween with
OL,4,Afood allergies?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLike a lot of other holidays, food
OL,7,Foften plays a big part in how people
OL,8,Fcelebrate Halloween, but it can be a
OL,9,Fmore complex to navigate if you have a
OL,10,Ffood allergy - especially if you want
OL,11,Fto go to parties or take children trick
OL,12,For treating.
OL,14,FHow do people with allergies ensure
OL,15,Fthey can take part in the fun and stay
OL,16,Fsafe? And how can you help make sure
OL,17,Fthat everyone is included in the
OL,18,Fcelebrations?
OL,20,FCiara, 15, is allergic to milk and
OL,21,Feggs.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
