OL,3,GNEWSAHow do you navigate Halloween with
OL,4,Afood allergies?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You have to make sure you read every
OL,7,Fpacket of everything, and you couldn't
OL,8,Feat anything until you got home so that
OL,9,Fyou were safe and you were sure of what
OL,10,Fwas happening," she said.
